+      "auto-routed model selected; the backend for this turn (local vs cloud) is not known ahead of the request, " +
+        "so read-size overflow protection cannot track the live local n_ctx for this session. " +
+        "Select local-model explicitly if you need that protection.",
+      { "session.id": sessionID },
