+// `model` unchanged when there's nothing to override. This is the single
+// place every `provider.getModel(...)` call site in the session layer should
+// route through — compaction sizing, the title model, and the synthetic Read
+// replay all need the SAME live window as the turn's own model, or they'll
+// size themselves against a stale/static `limit.context` while the turn's
+// actual overflow guard (SessionOverflow, src/tool/read.ts) uses the live one.
